    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom home, complete with a converted attic, to the market. No. 6 Ballycullen Green extends to approximately 115 sq. m. and offers generously proportioned accommodation, modern family living, and an impressive A2-rated BER.\n\nCarefully maintained and upgraded by its current owners, this exceptional home is presented in superb condition throughout. The accommodation is bright, spacious and beautifully designed, with a seamless flow ideally suited to modern family life.\n\nThe welcoming entrance hall leads to an elegant living room positioned to the left, while a guest WC is conveniently located off the hallway. To the rear, the property boasts a stunning open-plan kitchen and dining area, flooded with natural light and providing an ideal setting for everyday living and entertaining. A practical utility room is located off the kitchen, while the dining area enjoys direct access to the rear garden through patio doors.\n\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a contemporary family bathroom. The converted attic provides an additional versatile space with a variety of potential uses, ideal as a home office, playroom, or bedroom.\n\nA particular feature of this impressive home is the extra-large rear garden. Beautifully landscaped with a combination of patio and lawn, it provides an exceptional outdoor space for dining, entertaining and family enjoyment throughout the day.\n\nTo the front, there is off-street parking for multiple cars, while the property enjoys a superb position within the estate, overlooking the playground and playing field.\n\nBallycullen Green is a well-established residential development that enjoys a wealth of amenities on its doorstep. A selection of highly regarded schools, parks, sports clubs and recreational facilities are all within easy reach, while nearby shopping and dining options cater for everyday needs. Excellent public transport links, including the 15, 15A and F1 bus routes, provide convenient access to Dublin city centre, while the nearby M50 offers swift connectivity to Dublin's wider road network."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
