        "Content": "\n3D Tour - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=KhJGDNjyjie\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb three-bedroom family home</li><li> Converted attic providing versatile additional accommodation c. 15 Sqm</li><li> Approximately 115 sq. m. of well-proportioned living space</li><li> Impressive A2-rated BER</li><li> Bright and spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area</li><li> Additional family room with direct access to the rear garden</li><li> Extra-large, beautifully landscaped rear garden</li><li> Off-street parking for multiple cars</li><li> Excellent position overlooking the playground and playing field</li><li> Convenient location close to schools, amenities, public transport and the M50</ul>"
